  "ProjectGuid": "a24ff626-20e1-4fa8-a244-8ec3b836fcdc",
  "ProjectName": "Hockey Table Extraction to CSV",
  "Author": "",
  "ProjectDescription": "This project demonstrates how to extract structured table data from a website using FlowBlox. It retrieves hockey team statistics from scrapethissite.com, extracts team names, years, wins, and losses using XPath selectors, and exports the results to a CSV file (ExtractedTable.csv).",
